u/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:93:Key insight: Only border-connected wall components act as real barriers; interior wall fragments are decorations to be removed.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:94:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:98:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:105:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:111:Key insight: The connector pixels define the unique docking point and direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:112:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:116:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:123:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:130:Key insight: The legend's bar position (left vs right within its cell) is the encoding for turn direction at each obstacle color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:131:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:135:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:142:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:148:Key insight: Center color of each destination acts as a lookup key into the border colors of other sprites, enabling indirect color transfer.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:149:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:153:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:161:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:167:Key insight:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:169:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:173:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:180:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:185:Key insight: Holes are treated as part of the object for outlining, while only objects\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:187:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:191:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:199:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:204:Key insight:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:206:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:210:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:218:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:223:Key insight: Frames act as tally displays — scattered same-color patterns are \"absorbed\" and their count is shown as interior dots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:224:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:228:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:235:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:241:Key insight: Two distinct collision rules — 90° produces a gap and single-pixel diagonal lines; 45° produces no gap and thicker zigzag bands.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:242:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:246:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:254:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:259:Key insight:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:261:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:265:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:272:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:277:Key insight: Wall barriers restrict connectivity — only maroon pixels reachable via flood-fill through the floor qualify, so proximity alone isn't enough.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:278:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:282:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:290:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:295:Key insight: The path is a simple chain with no branches; choosing the top-left-most endpoint fixes a unique reading direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:296:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:300:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:308:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:313:Key insight: Cavity size determines tool–frame pairing; reflection triggers color swap.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:314:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:318:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:327:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:334:Key insight:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:336:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:340:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:347:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:352:Key insight: Diagonal pixels are hints marking where a straight line is broken; their span sets the maximum gap size to fill.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:353:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:357:<description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:364:Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:369:Key insight: Each marker's depth from the boundary defines its position in the cyclic palette; the pattern then tiles inward automatically.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:370:</description>\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:383:- `description`：一句话概述题目的变换目标。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:385:- `Rule`：从输入到输出的确定性变换规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/prompt.md:386:- `Key insight`：解题所需的核心洞见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:2:- `description`：根据边框形状匹配内外区域，将外部图案通过边框缺口\"投射\"进对应的封闭区域，投射方向由缺口朝向决定。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:10:- `Rule`：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:15:- `Key insight`：图案并非进入最近的房间，而是通过颜色钥匙间接匹配目标房间；缺口方向则决定图案在房间内的放置朝向和位置。两层映射（颜色匹配 + 空间投射）需要分别归纳。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:19:- `description`：将散落的彩色碎片按形状互补原则拼合成完整矩形，再根据拼合后矩形的面积大小关系确定输出排列顺序。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:27:- `Rule`：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:31:- `Key insight`：需要先通过\"形状互补\"这一非显然的几何关系找到正确配对，再通过面积排序决定输出布局。配对过程不是靠颜色或距离，而是靠形状的负空间匹配。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:35:- `description`：在被墙壁分割的网格中，根据每个区域内\"种子像素\"的颜色层级关系，逐层向外扩展填充，高层级颜色覆盖低层级颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:43:- `Rule`：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:48:- `Key insight`：表面上看是简单的 Voronoi 式填充（离谁近填谁的色），但当两个种子到某像素等距时，颜色优先级才决定归属。解题者必须从多个样例中归纳出隐含的全局颜色优先级顺序，这是第一层非平凡推理；同步扩展的空间填充逻辑是第二层。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:52:- `description`：识别网格中的\"指令箭头\"和\"货物块\"，箭头指示货物的移动方向，货物沿途会在经过的路径上\"印刷\"出自身颜色的痕迹，但痕迹的图案取决于货物的形状。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:60:- `Rule`：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:66:- `Key insight`：三层递进推理——先解读箭头方向，再理解形状拖尾的印刷机制，最后发现移动顺序由箭头与货物的间距隐式编码。间距信息容易被忽略，因为箭头形状看起来相似。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:70:- `description`：网格中的彩色环形边框内部隐藏着一个\"模板\"图案，需要提取模板并将其旋转后印刷到同色的目标区域上，旋转角度由环形边框的缺口位置编码。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:79:- `Rule`：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:84:- `Key insight`：缺口位置不仅仅是边框的装饰或入口标记，而是一个旋转指令的隐式编码。解题者需要先发现颜色匹配关系，再归纳出缺口方位与旋转角度的对应规则，最后注意到输出时颜色从 maroon 变为边框色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:88:- `description`：根据封闭区域内标记像素的相对位置关系，选择对应的几何变换（水平翻转、垂直翻转、转置）应用到区域内的彩色图案上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:96:- `Rule`：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:104:- `Key insight`：yellow 标记的空间排列方式（水平、垂直、对角）本身就是变换指令的编码——这不是\"标记在哪里\"而是\"标记之间的关系是什么\"。解题者需要忽略标记的绝对位置，关注它们的相对几何关系。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:108:- `description`：在网格中找到被\"遮罩块\"部分覆盖的底层图案，利用相同图案在其他位置的未遮挡副本来还原被遮盖的部分，输出仅包含还原后的遮罩区域。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:116:- `Rule`：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed2085404187/3/des.md:121:- `Key insight`：解题者需要理解 grey 块是一层\"遮挡\"而非实体对象，然后利用远处的完整副本作为\"参考答案\"来重建被隐藏的信息。这要求同时进行模式匹配（找到对应副本）和空间推理（对齐并填补缺失部分）。\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
